@@ -74,6 +75,30 @@
 # Gear no longer changes skills; weapons and armour carry Melee Accuracy,
 # Melee Strength, Melee Defence, Magic Accuracy, Magic Damage and Magic
 # Defence (mod_index=V_MELEE_ACC ... in the .itm files).
+#
+# Body Control and Clarity (step 15; gear cannot raise them; all in TENTHS
+# of a percent per skill level, so 3 = 0.3% per level, 30% at level 99):
+# body_control: raises the effective melee levels (accuracy, strength,
+#   defence, surround) after Tactics.
+# body_control_gather: added to the chance per try at rocks, trees and
+#   plants (2 = +0.2% per level, about +20% at level 99).
+# clarity: raises Fire/Lightning/Freeze strength, Fire/Lightning damage and
+#   your Immunity against spells.
+# clarity_luck: chance per resource gathered of one extra (2 = 0.2% per
+#   level, about 20% at level 99). The extra gives no XP and does not use
+#   up the rock or tree.
+# armor_class_percent: each Armor Class level raises the Armor, Melee
+#   Defence and Magic Defence of the armour you wear (items that need Armor
+#   Class) by this many tenths of a percent (5 = 0.5% per level, +49.5% at
+#   99). Negative values (the Magic Defence penalty on melee armour) are not
+#   changed.
+# weapon_skill_percent: the same for the weapon you wield: each level of the
+#   skill it needs (Dagger, Sword, Staff, Two-Handed, Hand to Hand) raises its
+#   Melee Accuracy, Melee Strength, Magic Accuracy and Magic Damage by this
+#   many tenths of a percent. Dagger level only helps daggers.
+# Both are worked out on you, never stored on the item: gear you trade away
+# keeps only its own values, and better gear always stays better for the
+# same player.
 config:
 bless_gather=10
 bless_craft=10
